  "categoryHints": {
    "_doc": "SUPC stems map deterministically to category. Sysco's 7-digit SKU is structured: the first 2 digits indicate the warehouse pick zone, which lines up almost 1:1 with our 9-bucket taxonomy. Stems are matched via row.sku.startsWith() — only the first 2 chars are consulted.",
